    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/9d9492853273fe6f6104ed4b9b6ea975.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a chilling spirit world and unravel the dark mysteries of your death in this  atmospheric indie horror game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7057786b31c59b2b9c488b1acdd1ae0c.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.poster.avif?t=1754525706\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.webm?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.mp4?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Interstice - Journey into Darkness</strong></i>, you step into the role of a lost soul trapped in the eerie limbo between life and death. Navigate an ever-changing environment and uncover fragments of your forgotten memories. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/f39b18f30839d4e0f93616b1e15520bf.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.poster.avif?t=1754525706\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.webm?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.mp4?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through chilling environments filled with cryptic clues and hidden memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Shape your story and uncover the secrets of your demise. There are two possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Design</strong> \u2013 Experience a haunting, immersive world crafted to evoke tension and mystery at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2013 There are no floating icons. Observe your surroundings to drive the narrative and piece the story together.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/9d9492853273fe6f6104ed4b9b6ea975.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a chilling spirit world and unravel the dark mysteries of your death in this  atmospheric indie horror game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7057786b31c59b2b9c488b1acdd1ae0c.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.poster.avif?t=1754525706\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.webm?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/3a56e24b0a73210ad4473cd58f8430f1.mp4?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Interstice - Journey into Darkness</strong></i>, you step into the role of a lost soul trapped in the eerie limbo between life and death. Navigate an ever-changing environment and uncover fragments of your forgotten memories. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/f39b18f30839d4e0f93616b1e15520bf.avif?t=1754525706\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.poster.avif?t=1754525706\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.webm?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/7424c254637874d0e282ae8e053b21d8.mp4?t=1754525706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through chilling environments filled with cryptic clues and hidden memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Shape your story and uncover the secrets of your demise. There are two possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Design</strong> \u2013 Experience a haunting, immersive world crafted to evoke tension and mystery at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2013 There are no floating icons. Observe your surroundings to drive the narrative and piece the story together.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Interstice - Journey into Darkness is a first-person horror game where players explore the Interstice, find candles holding memories of their past life, solve environmental puzzles, and complete character narratives to uncover the truth behind their death.",
